    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c1-s2-n15",
        "text": "在所有变换中，有一类变换保持距离不变。\n在这样的变换下，任意两点之间的距离都等于它们的像之间的距离。\n中心对称就是一种保距变换。\n\n下面证明这一点。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c1-s2-n15",
        "text": "设中心对称$Z_0$把空间中任意两点$M$和$N$分别映射成$M_1$和$N_1$（图60）。\n点$O$、$M$、$N$、$M_1$、$N_1$都在同一个平面内，用$\\alpha$表示这个平面。\n在中心对称$Z_0$下，平面$\\alpha$映射成自身。\n\n限制在这个平面内的映射，就是平面$\\alpha$内关于中心$O$的中心对称。\n平面内的中心对称保持距离不变，因此$|M_1N_1|=|MN|$。"
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "source-point-configuration",
        "description": "Original pixels show one shared plane, five dots M1 upper left, N1 left below O, O at the crossing, N right above O, M lower right, and four solid segments M1-N1, N-M, M1-M through O, N1-N through O. No arrows, dashes, ticks, grids, or numerical givens. Source-pixel observations are recorded in source-inventory.md. Exact pairing and distance equalities are approved-text regularization, not pixel measurements.",
        "requires": ["pointRelationships"],
        "objects": ["m1", "n1", "o", "n", "m", "m1-n1", "n-m", "m1-m", "n1-n"],
